{"title":"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Prove that there exists a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/d/2edcdf862c0d5b1d1ed80f320da2b804f9bd3be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k\\cdot2^n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> is composite for every integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Indeed, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/2/a924ec96f49b5730e8f931a0d88238faa1a58166.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{k=2935363331541925531}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"220\" height=\"26\" /> has the requisite property.\n</p><p>To see why, consider the primes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/8/0e836d1dc5890b1f34738d02ded26c8f13d6986a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3,\\ 5,\\ 17,\\ 257,\\ 65537,\\ 6700417,\\ 641$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"280\" height=\"16\" />, and observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/6/db63144529c0a088f7cc16722f2a8c7e21cfddfc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}k&amp;\\equiv 1\\pmod{3}\\\\ k&amp;\\equiv 1\\pmod{5}\\\\ k&amp;\\equiv 1\\pmod{17}\\\\ k&amp;\\equiv 1\\pmod{257}\\\\ k&amp;\\equiv 1\\pmod{65537}\\\\ k&amp;\\equiv 1\\pmod{6700417}\\\\ k&amp;\\equiv -1\\pmod{641}\\end{align*}\" width=\"177\" height=\"167\" />\n</p><p>Moreover, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/645bdc8512db9d39ffd03dc0c2494e1bd2e7bf73.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}\\text{ord}_{3}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=2\\\\ \\text{ord}_{5}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=4\\\\ \\text{ord}_{17}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=8\\\\ \\text{ord}_{257}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=16\\\\ \\text{ord}_{65537}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=32\\\\ \\text{ord}_{6700417}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=64\\\\ \\text{ord}_{641}\\left(2\\right)&amp;=64\\end{align*}\" width=\"139\" height=\"167\" />\n</p><p>We conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a24b3047d3ee80dfb875a145da7d840913bf7a00.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}n\\equiv 1\\pmod{2}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{3}\\\\ n\\equiv 2\\pmod{4}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{5}\\\\ n\\equiv 4\\pmod{8}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{17}\\\\ n\\equiv 8\\pmod{16}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{257}\\\\ n\\equiv 16\\pmod{32}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{65537}\\\\ n\\equiv 32\\pmod{64}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot\\left(-1\\right)+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{6700417}\\\\ n\\equiv 0\\pmod{64}&amp;\\implies k\\cdot 2^{n}-1\\equiv k\\cdot1+1\\equiv 0\\pmod{641}\\end{align*}\" width=\"550\" height=\"167\" />\n</p><p>And <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/2/6f29f9f359f1ff1a16056179d0673130a3ec6395.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k&gt;&gt;3,5,17,257,65537,6700417,641$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"295\" height=\"16\" /> so the relevant values will, in fact, always be composite. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO\" title=\"1982 USAMO\">1982 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1982 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173949\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 92/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1267/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2978/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.717      1 -total\n 58.43%    7.431      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 39.22%    4.988      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11831:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017173949 and revision id 155088. Rendering was trigge